        "note": "In a study published in Optical Fiber Technology, researchers from the Changchun Institute of Optics, Fine Mechanics and Physics of the Chinese Academy of Sciences have developed a new method to control multi-pulse generation in a 1972-nm mode-locked fiber laser. By applying external mechanical modulation to the optical fiber, the researchers generated multiple adjustable pulse patterns without increasing the pump power.",
